# Task: Post an Introduction on the Teacher Forum

<img src="https://images.code.org/c64d05d0d86301a775c1ff3daea57403-image-1776888103392.01.16 PM.png" alt="Screenshot of a thread in the teacher forum titled 'Welcome to Code.org! We are thrilled you have joined our community.'" style="float: right; height: 200px; clear: both; margin: 0 20px 20px 0;">

#### **Step 1:** Click on the "?" in the upper right hand corner of your screen.
#### **Step 2:** Select "Teacher forum" from the dropdown menu. 
#### **Step 3:** Click the magnifying glass at the top-right corner.
#### **Step 4:** Search for the thread, "Welcome to Code.org! We are thrilled you have joined our community." and click on it.
#### **Step 5:** Click "Reply" and introduce yourself to the  teacher community!
